ls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2742059, "client_id": 3665276, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/594e3736/uploads/origins/3d36a546-0f0e-43cb-b343-15a7a7a43651?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fbb2bd82eeb3cf9771a68a432a7a7170", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/594e3736/uploads/origins/3d36a546-0f0e-43cb-b343-15a7a7a43651?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7512373b6a0e5cba4a2b4b0a2a24884b", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは、リンゴ！\n\nあなたの画風がとても好きです！あなたのイラストの色使いはとてもきれいです！\n\nプレイヤーが採用したRPGのNPCの画像を依頼したいです。\n彼は若い王子です。\n\n[キャラクターの特徴］\n人間\n年齢】22歳\n身長：175cm\n体格痩せ型、華奢\n\n髪の色: ブロンド\nヘアスタイル：ショート、乱れ髪\n目の色: 青\n性格：ナイーブ、理想主義、親切、神経質、勇敢であろうとする\n\n服装\nURLに彼の服装のインスピレーションの参考画像を載せておきます。お好きなように改変してください！\n\nやはり黒とゴールドを基調とした衣装がいいですね。必須ではありませんが、赤のアクセントがあるといいですね。服は少し着古した感じにしてほしい。彼は王族の服を着たままこの冒険に流されましたが、それは多くのことを乗り越えてきたのです。\n\n\n[その他詳細］\nポーズ、背景、その他の詳細はお任せします！あなたの作風がとても好きで、芸術的直感を信じています！\n\n\nリクエストを読んでいただきありがとうございます！ご迷惑でなければ幸いです。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1rds9QKR1hxwBTTIjfdHi3IY9SI1E2AWQ?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@rinrinappleple/works/55", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d87eca9e/uploads/origins/92ae85f6-b184-46e5-81f3-308bd3d6ae05?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a2057dbe00d8b5d5431623bd594b09ad", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2742059, "client_id": 3614663, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@rinrinappleple/works/54", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/816a15b0/uploads/origins/34ff9b21-8fa3-4549-9362-4d85fdf25dab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=055c862d6cfe45257cd12123ff2faefb", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2742059, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@rinrinappleple/works/53", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2742059, "client_id": 2575332, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a3a9408a/uploads/origins/3c82bd27-bb21-434c-858c-219b07131747?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1b1bb51b71d4cd995fa1d8ad203a07ae", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a3a9408a/uploads/origins/3c82bd27-bb21-434c-858c-219b07131747?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e31e9be599a8c02a32551d583114aaf5", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは。はじめまして。\nメディア欄にある、影と光の描かれ方の雰囲気に惹かれました。\n\n夏の庭園に佇むオリキャラお姉さんのイラストをお願いしたいです。\n ・白いフリルのついた日傘 \n・布の多めのワンピース着用 \n・微笑み顔\n ・木陰、もしくは日傘の影の中にいる \n避暑地で出会った、夏の思い出の中にいるお姉さん…みたいな感じでお願いしたいです。 \n\nよろしくお願い致します。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1FmSjX8iiqo6pLNaaK0IuV689g0EX15Rb?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@rinrinappleple/works/52", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bcfe8b20/uploads/origins/c2d220e6-e1a5-4f55-8b64-74691964b546?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=73377f3838de02303077ce6342dd8400", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2742059, "client_id": 2533284, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@rinrinappleple/works/51", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/804f275c/uploads/origins/51ebde9c-0ee4-47b2-bd87-52787aee0f82?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9365d34e0636ebd8905f2ef6f405f593", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2742059, "client_id": 3517150, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@rinrinappleple/works/50", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cab40fe2/uploads/origins/178f12a4-77c2-4d9b-ad4e-ac16319f9d58?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4014ba3d3e51957e73578a79eb9f2893", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2742059, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@rinrinappleple/works/49", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2742059, "client_id": 3130565, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/dfd9b9c5/uploads/origins/9d21724c-c23d-4081-9b9d-3289e42ff90a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=510456027daec71b533284c00140bf18", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/dfd9b9c5/uploads/origins/9d21724c-c23d-4081-9b9d-3289e42ff90a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5b4fee7890228fdeb143babe0c7e3dbc", "src_set": ""}, "body": "お世話になっております。Twitchにてゲーム配信の活動をしているしゃちくさくと申します。\nリンゴ様の色彩と優しい絵柄がとても素敵だったので、ぜひ描いていただきたくリクエストしました！\n\n【依頼内容】\nしゃちくさくの歌ってみたMVに使用する一枚絵をお願いいたします。\n\nIWiSH「明日への扉」という楽曲の歌ってみた動画に使用します。\n扉(もしくは窓)から光が差す前でうさぎを抱いているイメージでお願いいたします。\n立ち絵の服装はスーツですが、固くなってしまうので、服装はワンピースに変更いただけますと幸いです。\n(衣装やその他の構成はお任せします！)\n\n可能であれば目の開閉等、表示差分をいただきたいです。\n\n【特徴】\n身体の特徴はリンクの立ち絵を参考にいただきたいです。\nデータは可能であれば人物・背景・メッセージを分けていただけますと大変助かります。\n\n【サイズ】\nメイン(顔と身体)が収まればサイズは問いません。\n\n以上、お忙しいところ恐縮ですが、ご確認の程宜しくお願いいたします。\nこれからも応援しています！\n\nしゃちくさく\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/11SoBnbXt7tBHCvOFVMAnDenivxY4MKdF", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@rinrinappleple/works/48", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2742059, "client_id": 3624494, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6f86a524/uploads/origins/dca26346-225c-4377-a2a6-f5c8b13f5d33?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=99b319be207aa63fe573fc1ea381d49f", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6f86a524/uploads/origins/dca26346-225c-4377-a2a6-f5c8b13f5d33?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cdb1f8d6c9277c0d1385e1ad95b0ef44", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hi ! I'm a really big fan of your soft artstyle and I'd love having my character drawn by you !! \n\nHe's an arrogant/chuunibyou wannabe knight/hero that want to be the best of them all, but the reality of it is that he's  way more bark than bite and just a big softie inside, he's kind of lazy, try to accomplish everything by pure charisma and luck but act like a golden retriever to his friends and familly.\n\nHe has a very JRPG/Fantasy vibe to him and is hugely inspired by the Xenoblade Series ! \n\nI'd love to see him sleeping peacefully against a tree in a vibrant environnement/forest, or just looking at us with a big goofy grin on his face blushing a little at night with a starry night sky, up to you to choose which one you prefer !\n\nHere's references of him : https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/12wcK-USdYFyc9ca1dtVJFuWxefNzGPBx?usp=drive_link\n\nThank you for your consideration !", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@rinrinappleple/works/47", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cca29c8a/uploads/origins/4c804cf6-9c8d-4f70-b391-d61ecccf816d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7abc1929ca6db66133bde8e34478ef19", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2742059, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@rinrinappleple/works/46", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2742059, "client_id": 2411514, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8236474d/uploads/origins/53c62a9e-f817-46e0-aaf3-351eeefc6e11?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=659cf5b9fcb6b8c32ed777ec09a9406f", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8236474d/uploads/origins/53c62a9e-f817-46e0-aaf3-351eeefc6e11?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8cd900734d671eeed97b02334165d90e", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！Fate/Grand Orderの \"雨の魔女トネリコ \"のペイントをお願いします。\n\nnuada(181cm)はとても優しくて、王子様のように振る舞います。\nトネリコ(170cm)は彼より控えめですが、彼のことをとても大切に思っています。\n\n二人の穏やかでロマンチックなシーンが最高です！舞台としては、夢のような森が好みです。\n\n金額が低すぎる場合は、遠慮なく再送してください！よろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-3GCF7YY0ahR0ndlVypCWMjcPZzFwsH_", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@rinrinappleple/works/45", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/54d7d02d/uploads/origins/67a0864f-1f22-452e-9269-e903c6e6eede?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=343c59310d8116dee3c28ab070f26f6c", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2742059, "client_id": 3450743, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@rinrinappleple/works/44", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2742059, "client_id": 1622498, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e113fbd2/uploads/origins/f4b59b43-2cde-413b-b9ac-fe5ac664a6f